cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "notata: Structured Filesystem Logging for Scientific Runs"
abstract: >-
  A minimal Python library for structured filesystem logging of scientific
  runs. Each run becomes a self-contained directory holding its parameters,
  arrays, plots, artifacts, metadata and a timestamped log, written as plain
  files with no server, database or dashboard involved.
type: software
authors:
